A reminder that travel for fieldwork requires an approved authorization bef=
ore booking, and that per diem is claimed at the rate for the duty location=
 rather than the rate for the office. Receipts are required for any expense=
 over $75. Vouchers submitted more than thirty days after return are return=
ed for explanation. Please treat the dates as firm.